{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Are you ready?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm going to explain it in one go.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Listen real carefully, OK?
The first thing you gotta understand
is that these turnips are, of course,
edible{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}But it's a fact no one here actually
buys these things for eating{{TAG:0003:0028:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
No, that'd just be silly.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Everyone uses these turnips to
make a profit in the stalk market.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hmmm. What else{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Right. You know about {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Re-Tail{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
You can sell your turnips there.
The price of turnips will go up and
down every day. Very fickle.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}So selling them when the price
is higher than what you bought
them for? {{TAG:0003:0025:}}That gives you a profit.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}On the other hand,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} selling them
when the price is lower {{TAG:0003:0025:}}will net
you a loss. Very tricky sometimes.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hazır mısın?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
